<title>USA: Cali to buy Harborside Financial center.</title>
<headline>Cali to buy Harborside Financial center.</headline>
<dateline>CRANFORD, N.J. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cali Realty Corp said it agreed to purchase Harborside Financial Center, a 1.9 million-square-foot office complex for $282.4 million.</p>
<p>The purchase of the Jersey City, N.J.-based property will increase Cali's total portfolio by 40 percent to about 6.4 million square feet, the company said.</p>
<p>The deal, which remains subject to due diligence, is expected to close within 45 days, Cali said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
